<h1>Password reset</h1>

<p><%= @user.name %>, to reset your Art Grant password click the link below:</p>

<p><%= link_to 'Reset password', edit_password_url(@resource, reset_password_token: @token) %></p>

<p>This link will expire in two hours.</p>

<p>If you did not request your password to be reset, please ignore this email and
your password will stay as it is.</p>
